<title>UK: ABN leads 1.2 bln Swedish crown asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>ABN leads 1.2 bln Swedish crown asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SAINT GORAN SECURITIES</p>
<p> AMT    1.2 BLN SKR   COUPON     7.35	LEGAL MAT	  2010</p>
<p> TYPE   ASSET-BACKED  ISS PRICE  100	 EXP MAT     01.NOV.03</p>
<p> SPREAD +50 BP	  REOFFER    98.77     PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/STOCKHOLM</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/IR</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.20 PCT  MGT/UND    0.12 PCT  SELL CONC  O.08 PCT</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED SWEDIDH GOVERNMENT BONDS.  NOTES	BACKED BY HOUSING LOANS.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
